OL,3,GNEWSASecurity increased after break-ins
OL,4,Aat vacated school
OL,5,
OL,6,FConcerns over the risk of fire or
OL,7,Fserious injury have been raised after
OL,8,Fvideos surfaced online showing masked
OL,9,Fintruders trespassing in a school which
OL,10,Fwas closed by the council last month.
OL,12,FSecurity at Monkseaton High School, in
OL,13,FWhitley Bay, has been increased,
OL,14,Ffollowing a series of TikTok videos
OL,15,Fshowing youths inside the building.
OL,17,FThe school closed on 31 August after
OL,18,FNorth Tyneside Council said there were
OL,19,Fno "viable options" to keep it open
OL,20,Fwith only 511 pupils on the school
OL,21,Froll, well below its 964 capacity, and
OL,22,Fa deficit of more than #8m..
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
